This crate's decoder (src/packet.rs, src/decoder.rs, src/trigon.rs) is a Rust port of parts of RoboSense's rs_driver
(https://github.com/RoboSense-LiDAR/rs_driver, commit 897b14d3bdb6186a75df27ba51b65b5bd5557723):

- packet layouts, constants, firing time tables, MSOP/DIFOP/IMU decoding:
  src/rs_driver/driver/decoder/decoder_RSAIRY.hpp
- DIFOP common fields (rpm, FOV, block azimuth step, beam angles): decoder_mech.hpp, chan_angles.hpp
- packet checks, frame splitting, sections, trig tables, block iterators, timestamp/temperature parsing:
  decoder.hpp, split_strategy.hpp, section.hpp, trigon.hpp, block_iterator.hpp, basic_attr.hpp
- the optional point transform (ENABLE_TRANSFORM) and cloud emission: decoder.hpp, lidar_driver_impl.hpp

tools/rs_driver_harness.cpp links rs_driver's headers (not redistributed here) to check the port against it.

